    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d247">

                <pb facs="0385" n="371" sameAs="frus:frus1945v09/pg371"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 EW/3–2745: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reed</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-03-27">March 27,
                        1945</date>.<lb/>[Received March 27—5:40 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>570. Farrell just informed press Argentina has declared war against Axis Nations.
                    Text of pertinent decree or decrees will be made public later this
                    afternoon.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Reed</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
